   "date": "2017-11-21T00:01:03Z",
   "subject": "Small error in spec function (and proposed fix)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">Hi</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">I&#39;ve been throwing a bunch of mathematically\r\ngenerated waves at the spec function and I&#39;ve noticed that it makes a small\r\nerror when the wave has an odd number of points in the time domain. \r\n I think this caused by the way that the vector of frequency bins is\r\ncalculated in the spec function.  </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">The error means that frequencies at the high end are, on average, in error by half the width of a fft frequency bin when there an odd number of points in the time domain.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">If there an even number of points, no problems  </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">In the spec function there is the code for the frequency bins x: </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> if\r\n(is.null(at)) {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> \r\n        x &lt;- seq(0, (f/2) - (f/n), length.out =\r\nn%/%2)/1000<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> \r\n      }<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> \r\n      else {<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> \r\n        x &lt;- seq(0, (f/2) - (f/wl), length.out =\r\nn%/%2)/1000<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> \r\n      }<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">This seems to work better (but I am not sure why)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">  if (is.null(at)) {</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">          x &lt;- seq(0, (f/2) - (f/n) - n%%2, length.out = n%/%2)/1000</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">        }</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">        else {</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">          x &lt;- seq(0, (f/2) - (f/wl) </span></font><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.3333px\">- n%%2</span><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">, length.out = n%/%2)/1000</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">        }</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\"><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13.3333px\">Dan</span></font></p></div>"
    ]
